You will be working within a large global advertising network, with opportunities for exposure and growth alongside world-class creative,&nbsp;production&nbsp;and craft teams. We are looking for a resourceful,&nbsp;creative&nbsp;and solutions-oriented individual with a refined, modern aesthetic-someone who is not afraid to push creative boundaries while delivering polished,&nbsp;effective&nbsp;and technically robust work. &nbsp;

You will be a creative generalist with&nbsp;a strong design&nbsp;point of view: someone who can take a brief, a set of boards, visual references or an existing creative direction and elevate it through thoughtful composition, typography, timing, animation,&nbsp;editing&nbsp;and storytelling. &nbsp;

You will create and deliver work across presentations, pitch films, social content, case studies, web content, animatics, broadcast projects, brand&nbsp;films&nbsp;and adaptation work. You will collaborate closely with Creative Directors, Designers, Editors, Producers, Project Managers and Client teams, contributing both hands-on craft and clear creative thinking. &nbsp;

The ideal candidate has a portfolio or reel that&nbsp;demonstrates&nbsp;sophisticated motion graphics, strong typographic&nbsp;design&nbsp;and an artistic, contemporary visual sensibility. You are comfortable working independently when needed, while collaborating effectively within a fun, fast-paced, ego-free studio environment. &nbsp;

